  <metadata>
    <name>Chopta, Tungnath &amp; Chandrashila Trek (DHT route)</name>
    <desc>Route recorded by DHT on 2026-10-30. Conditions change. Not a substitute for a guide, local advice or weather checks.</desc>
    <author><name>Discover Himalayan Trails</name></author>
